  "title": "Q078 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 078</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>78 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"78번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:72%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q078\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">이전 문제 <b>Q077</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q079/\">다음 문제 <b>Q079</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
